  + [baseline] is existing deterministic parser output plus attributed human or Observer adjudication
  + [exact_target] is signed MinimalCommittedEntry transactions and rebuildable exact SemanticFabric projections
  + [learned_target] is optional fabric-bound embeddings, router, denoiser, graph model, or transition model only after adoption gates
